== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @minced fresh ginger{2/3%tbsp}, @minced scallions{5/12%cup}, @low sodium gluten-free tamari{1%tbsp}, @red pepper flakes{1/12%tsp}, @rice vinegar{2/3%tbsp}, @honey{2/3%tbsp}, @sesame oil{1/3%tbsp}, @minced garlic{1/3%tbsp}, @lean ground beef{1/3%lb}.

== Preparation ==

Prepare ingredients and any grains or vegetable sides.

Cook protein using an appropriate method until safe doneness, then combine with prepared sauce and garnishes.
